# ST0-TQ1: e1m3's small flame (the light_flame_small_yellow at -1352,-432,14), every
# option off, in the Classic box (960x600 shown 4:3). One render for two film shots: ST0
# ("Now, the slop") is frames 0 to 509, TQ1 frames 390 to 659. A slow push in, always
# looking at the flame: at rest at the start, half way at file second 7.5, at rest again
# at 10.0 on ST1c's view; a little faster after the cut. The torches wake at 7.8 (`cvar
# r_torchflicker 1 at 7.8`), TQ1's 0.3 s. Brightness 0.7. The camera's keys are dense
# (every 1/30 s): the push is a pair of cubic Hermite pieces no key-and-ease line gives.

map e1m3

duration 11
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset classic
mode 960x600
display 4:3
hud off
cvar gamma 0.7
cvar r_torchflicker 1 at 7.8

camera path
key 0.0000  -1352.000,-600.000,-30.000  at -1352,-432,14  ease linear
